o.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/DVzlv5mo0vr88SXh6MrATYFvhOT8bIdr.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"すべての方に、祝福を！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/CG0ofAzCsgaZPCV7fOHt6WbCTbii6dbi.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"すべての方に、救いを！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/EMVfXU6KxE4TRgPr9o59QEcD4LrvuhT7.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"すべての方に、ご加護を！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/XNKlctSo7wQkpEp5xVQ3ycGtjwEpYhCC.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"あまり、武器は使いたくないのですが…… 平和のためでしたら。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/8a4Oi9MKfF6aTLG6T0sY7AqgqfOXR3l1.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"これが、私に与えられた運命でしたら","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/evAXXYNK94vfQGW3S1ynD6vT4Vb8aQ1C.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"はい、喜んで","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/2Pj6c5ck3XD3d0KNzxfGDiy7zqLVrKqn.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"全ての出会いは必然…… これからどうぞよろしくお願いします、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/GDcEM0f9ff41rKgwDnFwnPdJ22C3cI0A.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"そのお気持ちに応えられるよう、誠心誠意、努力いたしますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/sDXIGld0NSKvcSyZGXBY80sr1fl6hjPZ.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"聖なる力が、体の中にあふれて……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/IxXgi5bCn8TuBYGSm9CmVvAcedHLw02B.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"今後も、より一層精進して参ります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/DtWavsVmPY1ZpO0WeKOSdg95l3acI16U.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"こんなに素敵なものを、私に……これを、私がいただいてしまっても、良いのでしょうか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/3ToZwUUOKHH4Pa6qfRpRvs0c580PctIL.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"少し、お話を聞いていかれませんか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/jz5yG75AMH4EZKgDkJrTWTnSrmMII0xw.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ふ、不埒なことは駄目ですよ……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/Sflnd9qfFM33wAyrMriNUmTWBbfaYuot.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"（私の祈りが、先生を守ってくれますように……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/gLHg2DLQURieadc0hGWNl8umm0lraO1r.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"辛いときは、私に頼ってくださっても良いのですよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/lbI11RIyFtV0lI78D66HbYjaOvqwhzl6.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生でしたら……いえ、きっと大丈夫です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/EMxpriyGm4YFv2LHU9vdv9dewCult41C.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、先生。 今日もお会いできて嬉しいです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/gpTuvLZQTKSYUpasnYEsMACYcNSXHKeL.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日も良い一日になりますように、祈っておりますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/MVufx8uTzkx1o4Tu69dieW5pvyJ2N2LT.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"……来ていただいてありがとうございます、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/uxSDxZngfgV6IIiYQeb3Q39YDQOMQovO.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"はい、先生のことを 祈っておりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/9F56qmwc1c6JXKEdqg6enXsGQj27pHur.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"このように静かな場所は、お祈りにピッタリです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/GVFdSygwKWVj4egLhUGVODry5UCrM98Z.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"祈っているはずの私の心も、 まるで洗われていくようで……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/0qvLpLSnVIv0ne52kxtw45bGR1mmiyae.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生がこれまで積み上げてきた道、そしてこれから選ばれる道……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/Jd4hTbGS3PVJhFyarGpGKbSwQfO7aqlV.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"そこにどうか、 できるだけ多くの平和と、幸せがありますように……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/ySORdZSaeosU8HmlsXg29ZlF5pMrEcol.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ん、自分のことも祈らないの、ですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/lGjQWiw5d42khl4Volb5ILcMqrPck9aN.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"それは…… いえ、大丈夫なんです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/amIYnYNRxAUEMgn5AnBVlH3dTx2MiQJ0.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"先生が幸せでしたら、私も幸せですので。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/NnceBP3NO1UNEkzCH8LFnPJ7YcY1JTi3.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"つまりこれは、 私たちのための祈り……なのかもしれません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/dxzj00lz22fyn6afkSZu71zn8sLN5eFv.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"なんだか、心が安らぐようです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/2cPkN0cAzZlnzHc9CDUyQoJgGqQCY1ya.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"先生、私、先生のことを心から尊敬しております。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/cV6ExkpvrF3Cu15v3QC7u4TsmgNJsO91.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":" 愛とは崇高なもの。ですが…困りましたね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/Mc2yXpUbH5DR2j3ejDlkpbwjD82BwLlI.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"どうしましょう……。この気持ちは……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/YLzHSbH3zkZy5hVGa0N4JKUuOnsFQX44.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日にこうして、先生と一緒にいられるだなんて…… 幸せ過ぎてなんだか、 あとで罰が下ってしまわないか心配です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/pRvfoNcBR7rmh7Ap3dOapkYm1b63t6Tx.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日この日に先生が生を受けたからこそ、 私たちはこうして出会うことができました。 今日という日に、 心からの感謝を。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/bkkP3izalVPxMdoPpPSYemC3kPP9VSHL.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"飴さん……あ、いえ、大丈夫です。 シスターとして、 節制は大切ですので。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/IxMSCJcTaYbIwphC1Ke4bV3RgVeRnfia.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"あけましておめでとうございます。 今年はどんな素敵なことが待っているのか…… 今から楽しみですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/4EFMfT1GTQC877NugVNmjfcP1sjNJ3Sa.ogg"},{"description":"Mari_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"今日は、偉大なる方の降誕祭……。 敬虔に、 この聖なる一日を過ごすとしましょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/kT8uOjuUU1XAPMSo4zyFBpIHyBuvnhKg.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"mari_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"我感受到了神圣的气息……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/SakYEHZO7GUHKdFS69gFow6RpMAGpApD.ogg"},{"description":"mari_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"今天天气也很好呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/UhMBaiMjLcgJ8YX231qSk5XCpz5eRPkH.ogg"},{"description":"mari_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"只是一小会儿的话……在这儿稍微歇一歇再走，也没关系吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/N9tmvAfARlopb131j6FeBk7kXA9slBZF.ogg"},{"description":"mari_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"愿和平与你同在。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/RCpKofVZTNIilGjyWqHJW3YSQwmLz8zT.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"神圣之力呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/EjpkHQdE0Yx3EuLfeaeTVPAbUr9F3WqF.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"首先，献上祈祷。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/knNPppi8gJS5TJNZHZAh5RAv278wD96T.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"衷心祈愿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/6yJyE8mOL0Twexeg0L3C1UF9Q9CmdZqC.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"为诸位献上祝福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/BdAo2ceyRzlQvob6qKLssqo7wsWTkYdS.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"为诸位带来救赎。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/oAxMJaOXfarQGTftl63zESwBTGpTY9b6.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"为诸位施以加护。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/C2YT8tyuOc2tQlcgchCAz8cLAd8FDhbC.ogg"},{"description":"mari_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"虽然我不想使用武器……但这是为了和平。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/TYNeR1ZA8Y0p2HUNxGujawoNjKtLO2IO.ogg"},{"description":"mari_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"如果这就是我的命运……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/KfTINL1ijGnXBiJr61cf9BUW83LFjrbn.ogg"},{"description":"mari_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"非常荣幸。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/QJvtSSaILeBdX2KRkdncRrFqY6kYrkn3.ogg"},{"description":"mari_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"一切相遇皆是必然……老师，请多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/veT5ethEAcunNHNk87FvgC6RsqMt1TE6.ogg"},{"description":"mari_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"为了回应您的信任，我将尽我所能。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/d1XtxTH6qZjynQNMLAfpQqLaD0ioMhNo.ogg"},{"description":"mari_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"神圣的力量溢满全身。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/aotiwriouURSmR0b2gAqgsRRdWV6SOuK.ogg"},{"description":"mari_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"今后，我也将继续精进。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/l6GEZE3EhwxQGUV4IpSHjluBZXv5AyGr.ogg"},{"description":"mari_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"这么美好的东西，我，真的可以收下吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/YemvFzcWC7O3KRdeUFFSbx9S2vB9jP7k.ogg"},{"description":"mari_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"有一句良言，您想听吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/h6BqaR2dreKTVQdDrpCItMhu5NGfGRnX.ogg"},{"description":"mari_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……不，不敬之事，请您克制……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/QUKjdOnlcDTCwzkPXXzdqZINKAFohkAy.ogg"},{"description":"mari_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"（希望我的祈祷能守护老师……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/K1s0BBHOOW2fSzRIhEAxaXMRpkAP5SPu.ogg"},{"description":"mari_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"疲惫的时候，可以依赖我哦。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/leSUpUijN0cYiq6Du6gAvKOokXoQ20ER.ogg"},{"description":"mari_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"如果是老师的话，或许…… 嗯，一定没关系的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/sX65zfBs1lH49YNmZV760LUcABRgH13h.ogg"},{"description":"mari_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"您来了，老师。今天您也依然那么耀眼呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/O6csgg8959fJsuqrkjn7c1eGQwRiMDQA.ogg"},{"description":"mari_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"愿恩典常伴您左右。希望您今天也能度过美好的一天。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/JXX2exMFlChRQGd8oXzPS2HJeI0v0Ob6.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"……感谢您的到来，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/4a8wrRu9X8BlkXbfbwu3aL9MjZk8D4sw.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，我正在为老师祈祷。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/TZ1ZkrV3ZoeqMTVvngxBxK3TQQF0eyJY.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"像这种肃静的地方，正适合祈祷。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/JOhX0vz7KHDFqr8XCXQse9slAhE2sLFc.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"祈祷的时候，我的心灵也会变得澄静……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/YBppwgCKFKuWi2r199s8QMa3iMfzKpuM.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"我祈愿，老师在至今为止走过的道路上，还有未来选择的道路上……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/7ZaRtbkkxCFhALQLVe8figsULquZzqDO.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"愿您在每一条路上都有和平相随，与幸福相伴……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/Mw7zPLTkyTzWVR0aad4Ai0wyUXmzNyb5.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？我有没有为自己祈祷过？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/0qcs0iTcg1lPTRlnPNB5RfMayRZVekQ1.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……这个嘛，没关系。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/9cqExTuYDscdSw8EfRXMqCV0C4r1lPTX.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"因为看到老师幸福，我也会感到幸福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/xUK6cdzrqbMxEYo0XBkXhifkDJOf4JQc.ogg"},{"description":"mari_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"也可以说，这就是为了……我们两个人的幸福而祈祷呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/qiHz7IxuFuesDUILduwpwMCmUEQqDJxs.ogg"},{"description":"mari_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"不知为何，有种安心的感觉。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/rTh96DYAqqA7CDgb6cOAzewqfuLPeAJa.ogg"},{"description":"mari_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"老师，我……我真心地尊敬您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/zeZyOa7RWkp7jlEOtaHSnaAjCn83WPAv.ogg"},{"description":"mari_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"爱是崇高的，但是……真是苦恼……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/Cra5gai0u2iOsjqTYRUum9rqdLAF6Cv0.ogg"},{"description":"mari_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"嗯，该拿这种心情，如何是好呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/KX4NkIqOnSFgSCE4jsOwbEkw1qDytCsX.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"竟然能这样跟老师一起过生日…… 我都有些担心了，收到了这么棒的礼物，我不会因此受到惩罚吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/GdMqX0UrgsPbGaly6tvdukxcIOBoNDrZ.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"正因为老师在这一天诞生了，我们才能像这样相遇。 在今天这个特殊的日子里，我将送上衷心的感谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/UAXitkDi6v1J1Bl5FMYXoefeVyIgAES1.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春快乐。愿和平与安宁今年也与您同在。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/BHuiXzYohMURczT9co2RELSp2KJ2rbsj.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"糖果……就不用了。 毕竟禁欲是姐妹会的美德之一。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/r1vI8hf2btKyPisvhmCBwH3EXKA9uT3Y.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"在这样的节日，能和老师一起仰望明月，我感到无比安宁。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/4Apvy8b3w4AuHaqjKcav4abBZYQ8wJIz.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐！今年又会有什么开心的事在等着我们呢？ 我已经开始期待了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/8to20dJky5vrtO4iQWCTefN6oXu5Zoqs.ogg"},{"description":"mari_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"今天是伟大的圣子诞生的祝日啊。 希望今天能度过虔诚神圣的一天。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/MgnraZJjWLi8Xh4GPeygCBVLgQDlGx9b.ogg"},{"description":"mari_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/rQmudMmPASdS8GZSaLr3i78rsiC3Ij3V.ogg"},{"description":"mari_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"请保佑我们，前路平安。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/BqJn82LR8ZlX68RtfzpIISU8VhG6yJqp.ogg"},{"description":"mari_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"注意安全，不要受伤。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/hl5mra94rOdGG0vxgODQcMKvkGHOUKNn.ogg"},{"description":"mari_cafe_act_1","category":"cafe","text":"愿祝福降临此处。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BC%8A%E8%90%BD%20%E7%8E%9B%E4%B8%BD/5P23Lm1UticR2qcQsguWSWzBO8T3WniE.ogg"},{"d